## What does this PR do?
This PR enabled [botID](https://vercel.com/docs/botid) when triggering the api/book/event route. 

## How should this be tested?

To test this you should add `NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_USE_BOTID_IN_BOOKER="1"` in your .env
You can now add BAD-BOT to the development options to test a failed event or set to human to test a passing event. 
``` 
const verification = await checkBotId({
    developmentOptions: {
      bypass: 'BAD-BOT', // default: 'HUMAN'
    },
  });
```
